  peaceful
  serene
  calm
  grateful
  affectionate
  trust
  sympathetic
  anticipation
  mysterious
  angry
  mad
  outraged
  frustrated
  agitated
  threatened
  disgusted
  contempt
  envious
  sarcastic
  ironic
  sad
  dejected
  melancholic
  disappointed
  hurt
  guilty
  bored
  tired
  rejected
  nostalgic
  wistful
  apologetic
  hesitant
  insecure
  confused
  resigned
  anxious
  panicked
  alarmed
  scared
  proud
  confident
  distant
  skeptical
  contemplative
  determined
